	      ?tp  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range>  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal>.
	FILTER  (?tp != <http://udbl2.it.uu.se/swatm#IDTOPIC>).} ";

